n: 3.14.1.3
name: spec-ice-code-water-binary-gas
kind: observation
is: Living Codex commit 721e2c7 of 2025-09-12, under the owner's name with no assistant trailer, defines "Spec (Ice): Persistent, immutable source of truth", "Code (Water): Generated from spec, can be regenerated" and "DLL (Gas): Compiled from code, ephemeral runtime artifacts". Its message says: "Only specs (ice) need to be persistent".
