n: 3.14.2.8
name: homes-of-node-population
kind: observation
is: In the old runtime the words name the home of the whole node population: ice is the shared field, "content-addressed, shared by every kernel on the host, outlives all of them"; water is the per-pid shared store, "gone when this pid goes"; gas is the private heap, "RAM only". Exactly one of kernel_stat rows 58, 59, 60 carries the whole population.
