n: 3.14.3
name: owner-statements
kind: hub
is: The owner's attested words on the three states are the 2025 spec and code under the owner's name, eight short statements recorded by assistants from 2026-05-27 to 2026-09-08, and one memory note. Read together: state belongs to a node and is not its kind; a move removes nothing and is invited by measurement; ice is shared as it is, water is serialized and re-addressed, gas is in RAM; ice is kept small; compiled code is not ice. No definition written by the owner was found.
at: 2026-11-24

